  "contentHtml": "<p>작년부터 종종 노트북LM으로 PPT를 자주 만들어 사용하고 있습니다.</p><p>올해는 거의 노트북LM을 활용했는데, 마음에 들어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>노트북LM 돌려보면, 생각지 못한 설명팁들을 중간중간 발견할 수 있어서도 좋아요. 적절한 비유도 많구요.</p><p>예를 들면, 별의 연주시차를 구할 때, 6개월 간격으로 별을 관측하여 구한다는 걸 설명할 때,</p><p>별까지의 거리는 너무나 멀기 때문에&#160;<b>우주에서 가장 거대한 &#39;두 눈&#39;</b>을 만드는 거라고 말해줄 수 있어요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/21c7a9189d9ea31af00a54642ffe235e570b4842\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/21c7a9189d9ea31af00a54642ffe235e570b4842\" data-origin-width=\"578\" data-origin-height=\"323\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>이 단원에서 아이들에게 별빛개념성장일지를 작성하라고 하면서 질문을 1개씩 만들고 답을 쓰라고 했는데</p><p>아이들이 사실적 질문, 개념적 질문, 논쟁적 질문을 어려워 할 것 같아서</p><p>1차시 별까지의 거리, 2차시 질문만들기 이렇게 진행했습니다~</p><p>이것도 노트북LM에&#160;</p><p>&quot;&#160;<span style=\"color: #303030; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">학생에게 질문만들기에 대한 수업을 하려고 해. 질문에 대해 먼저 설명하고, 그 다음 별까지의 거리 단원에서 질문 만들기를 연습하려고 하는데 이걸 설명하는 슬라이드 만들어줘. 중학교 2학년 대상으로 너무 어렵지 않게. 재미있게&quot;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #303030; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">이렇게 말했더니 만들어줬어요. 이건 용량이 커서 pdf로 첨부합니다~</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>노트북LM에 버튼만 누르면 나오는 PPT이지만</p><p>그때그때 다른 PPT를 만들어내니, 제것도 참고하시도록 올려드립니다^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>별까지의 거리</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a93d837e23c9be17c0b908155a62b0ac078c89b?download\" data-file-name=\"별까지의거리.pptx\" data-file-size=\"11989405\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1626%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260908021440&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6a93d837e23c9be17c0b908155a62b0ac078c89b')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">별까지의거리</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">11.43MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>질문 만들기</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c30d97b34953cb46e90e533a9d0a35a563a4049?download\" data-file-name=\"(질문만들기)Space_Detective_Master_Class.pdf\" data-file-size=\"1785515\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1626%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20260908021440&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4c30d97b34953cb46e90e533a9d0a35a563a4049')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">(질문만들기)Space_Detective_Master_Class</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.70MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1a5113c0b4f828fbe073542609b0325510773ed?download\" data-file-name=\"질문만들기_별까지의거리_한글.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"54220\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1626%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20260908021440&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fb1a5113c0b4f828fbe073542609b0325510773ed')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">질문만들기_별까지의거리_한글</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">52.95KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9562bed23843f643df2c43921ca69198cadd9e12\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9562bed23843f643df2c43921ca69198cadd9e12\" data-origin-width=\"2752\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>학생 활동지</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fe844458ea07f6454c2f0cc16abf9c1a712cb73?download\" data-file-name=\"별까지의거리(질문만들기).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"43114\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1626%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20260908021440&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3fe844458ea07f6454c2f0cc16abf9c1a712cb73')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">별까지의거리(질문만들기)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">42.10KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>질문을 입력하면 1~5단계로 평가해주는 사이트</p><p><a href=\"https://ask.smile.seedsofempowerment.org/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://ask.smile.seedsofempowerment.org/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Ask SMILE\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"ask.smile.seedsofempowerment.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://ask.smile.seedsofempowerment.org/\" data-og-url=\"https://ask.smile.seedsofempowerment.org/\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://ask.smile.seedsofempowerment.org/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://ask.smile.seedsofempowerment.org/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Ask SMILE</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">ask.smi